f lines with no active author. It also doesn't give the 37% left-owned figure. The quantification is missing.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Answer B doesn't compare icanhazstring's line share with their commit share. It also doesn't give Carlos's and Kévin's percentages. It does note they are inactive, but the core comparison is absent, so the criterion fails.\", \"pass\": false}], \"C\": [{\"n\": 1, \"reason\": \"Answer C names Ben the largest owner at 62.6% of non-blank lines and 60.9% with blanks overall. Both are within 55-63%. It also keeps <email redacted> merged.\", \"pass\": true}, {\"n\": 2, \"reason\": \"Answer C doesn't mention Katarzyna Nowak. It lists contributors down to about 0.5% without her, so her 2.2% is absent. The criterion fails.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 3, \"reason\": \"Answer C gives Tomasz Wrona 1.9% (1.8% with blanks), within 0.8-2.5%. It excludes the generated TypeMap and doesn't credit the bot with lines beyond a small note. It did not run with --ignore-rev for the rename and cs-fixer commits, though, and it says so. It also doesn't discuss src/Support. The mechanical commits are therefore not excluded, which is a partial miss. The numbers still land in range.\", \"pass\": true}, {\"n\": 4, \"reason\": \"Answer C states bus factor 1 and says Ben holds 62.6%. However, it says the bus factor after he leaves would be 3. It doesn't state that ~96% of lines would have no active author. It reports 35.4% of lines held by people with no recent commit, which is in the 33-42% range, but the key figure is missing. The criterion is not met.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Answer C gives icanhazstring 11.7% of lines against 10.1% of commits. Its commit count is distorted by counting only commits touching src/tests, so the gap is far smaller than ~5%. It does show Carlos at 7.0% (last 2016) and Kévin at 7.0% (last 2018), and it excludes the bot. But it doesn't state that the line share is well above the commit share, so the central point is missing.\", \"pass\": false}]}", "ttft_ms": 12434, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 12455, "uuid": "1f673a94-8a3f-453f-80e3-69991432357b", "ttft_stream_ms": 1912, "time_to_request_ms": 437, "first_content_frame_ms": 1912, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
